<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73262" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλοόφρων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ονος</span>,
			ὁ, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλοός, φρήν</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>meaning mischief, baleful</i> (so always in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
			</span></i>), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					2.723
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					15.630
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῦς κάπρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					17.21
				</span></i>
			 ; but </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i>, <i>crafty, sagacious,</i> of persons, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄτλας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.52
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Αἰήτης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					10.137
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μίνως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.322
				</span></i>
			. (Sense <i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i> is derived from sense <i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, cf. the signf. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαΐφρων</span>
			and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεινός</span> ; expld. by <i><span class="en">
				Cleanth.Stoic.
				1.125
			</span></i> by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ὑπὲρ ὅλων φρονῶν,</span>
			i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁλο-.</span>)</div>
